  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promotion of the Documentation of Foreigners and Structural Strengthening in Border Points and Delegations of the Provinces of Argentina</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project assists in the development of cooperation and technical assistance activities for the National Directorate of Migration (DNM), with the aim of strengthening its management and administration capacities in the development of processes related to the regularization of foreigners, and structural strengthening of the border points and delegations of the provinces of Argentina, in which it exercises the competencies inherent to it in accordance with what is established by Law No. 25.871 and its Regulatory Decree No. 616/2010.</narrative>
  </description>
